Organization-wide management commands.

USAGE:
  scw iam organization <command>

AVAILABLE COMMANDS:
  enable-saml Enable SAML Identity Provider for an Organization
  enable-scim Enable SCIM for an Organization
  get-saml    Get SAML Identity Provider configuration of an Organization
  get-scim    Get SCIM configuration of an Organization

FLAGS:
  -h, --help[=true|false]                help for organization
      --list-sub-commands[=true|false]   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -B, --beta[=true|false]         Enable beta mode
  -c, --config string             The path to the config file
  -D, --debug[=true|false]        Enable debug mode
  -H, --no-headers[=true|false]   Skip headers in human output
  -o, --output string             Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string            The config profile to use

Use "scw iam organization [command] --help" for more information about a command.
